OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including a live concert
OL,9,     Ffrom the NOVO Quartet at Wigmore
OL,10,     FHall in London.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,12,     F1/5. Kate Molleson follows young
OL,13,     FVerdi, whose ambitions soon
OL,14,     Foutgrow his surroundings.
OL,15,G1700 In Tune
OL,16,     FLive music from bass-baritone
OL,17,     FMarcus Coleridge and pianist Henry
OL,18,     FSmith. Actor, director and
OL,19,     Fplaywright Steven Berkoff on his
OL,20,     Fnew memoir.
